            <ArticleTitle>Respiratory complications due to inadequate analgesia following thoracotomy in a neonate.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>879-80</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case in which a 2-day-old infant suffered respiratory complications shortly following premature termination of a postoperative extradural infusion. Restoration of analgesia led to a marked clinical improvement.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
